[{"answer":"I am not superstitious, are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yesterday was Friday the 13th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people think that Friday the 13th is an unlucky day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that it is just like any other day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people believe that if a black cat crosses your path, you will have bad luck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't believe that either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother always gets upset if I open an umbrella in the house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/7.mp3"},{"answer":"She says that is bad luck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/8.mp3"},{"answer":"She is probably right about that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Because an open umbrella would take up a lot of space,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and you might knock things over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/11.mp3"},{"answer":"If your left hand is itchy, you are supposed to get money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I have had an itchy left hand before, but I haven't received any money because of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It is bad luck to walk under a ladder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That is probably true because you might knock somebody off the ladder,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/15.mp3"},{"answer":"or have a can of paint fall on top of you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/16.mp3"},{"answer":"If you are acting in a play, it is bad luck if someone says \"Good luck to you\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/17.mp3"},{"answer":"This is very confusing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You are supposed to tell an actor to \"break a leg\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't mean that you want the actor to break his leg.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/20.mp3"},{"answer":"It means good luck to the actor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Actors have a lot of superstitions that are very unusual.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I am not superstitious.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't believe in superstitions at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It is just fun to learn about superstitions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of them are very old and have been passed down from generation to generation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I once did a project at school on superstitions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a very interesting topic, and I got a good mark for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/111-superstitions-2019-04-07-03-58-21/28.mp3"}]
